@EventsAssistant.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7241

### List upcoming events
GET {{EventsAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events

### Get event details
GET {{EventsAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/1

### Book a seat
POST {{EventsAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendeeName": "Peter"
}

### Ask the AI assistant
POST {{EventsAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What events are coming up?"
    }
  ]
}
